{"Title":"An Act relative to community works programs","BillNumber":"H3413","DocketNumber":"HD3972","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"D_R1","Name":"David Allen Robertson","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/D_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:41:30.437"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"D_R1","Name":"David Allen Robertson","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/D_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:41:30.4366667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3413/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Robertson of Tewksbury, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3413) of David Allen Robertson for legislation to allow for participation in community works programs for violations of certain motor vehicle laws.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSection 24 of Chapter 90 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting the following: “; to participate in a program to provide services to municipalities within a county pursuant to section forty-nine C of chapter one hundred twenty-seven;” after the words “to engage in employment pursuant to a work-release program” every time they appear.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}